    {"h": "FIRST AID", "items": ["Move victim to fresh air", "Call 911 or emergency medical service", "Give artificial respiration if victim is not breathing", "Administer oxygen if breathing is difficult", "Remove and isolate contaminated clothing and shoes", "In case of contact with substance, immediately flush skin or eyes with running water for at least 20 minutes", "For minor skin contact, avoid spreading material on unaffected skin", "Wash skin with soap and water", "Keep victim warm and quiet", "Ensure that medical personnel are aware of the material(s) involved and take precautions to protect themselves"]}
